@page "/about"
<PageTitle>About — Free Library</PageTitle>
<h1 class="firstHeading">About Free Library</h1>

<p>
    <strong>Free Library</strong> is a static website: the entire catalogue is loaded once into your browser,
    so searching and browsing are <em>instant</em>. The only server work happens when you press
    <em>Download PDF</em> — a tiny serverless function counts the download and sends you to a
    short-lived link for the file.
</p>
<p>
    There are <strong>no accounts, no cookies and no tracking</strong> beyond an anonymous download counter.
    Every book is freely available and provided as-is.
</p>
<p>
    Built with <a href="https://dotnet.microsoft.com/apps/aspnet/web-apps/blazor" rel="noopener noreferrer">Blazor WebAssembly</a>
    and deployed on <a href="https://vercel.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vercel</a>.
</p>
